    ["老尼尔，黑荆棘资历最深的老前辈之一。他会教你冥想、灵视，还会教你在报销单上如何“合理”填数字。但他欠账三十镑时，也能对捡来的三百镑钱包分文不动。\n“为所欲为，但勿伤害”，是他恪守一生的格言。\n他曾是正式值夜者，但离晋升始终差了那么一步。年纪渐长，教会让他转做“看守者”或回家休养，他拒绝了。他只愿留在黑荆棘，守着那些泛黄的典籍，为大家点亮一盏灯。\n在平常幽默风趣的相处中，没人知道，老尼尔一直在节省资金，试图用禁忌的“生命炼成”仪式复活亡妻。他在需要鲜血材料的配方旁写道：“可以考虑抽取我的。”——他宁愿用自己的血，也不愿伤害任何人。\n直到隐匿贤者的低语吞没他，队友亲手送别他……当值夜者们翻开老尼尔的日记，看见最后一页写着：“如果不能拯救她，那就去陪伴她。”时，他们终于明白了老尼尔最后的坚守。\n他想用余生为年轻人照亮一小段路，然后用生命，践行一句无人知晓的誓言。"] = "Old Neil, one of the most senior veterans of the Blackthorn Security Company. He would teach you meditation, spirit vision, and how to \"reasonably\" fill in numbers on reimbursement forms. Yet, when he owed thirty pounds, he could remain unmoved by a wallet containing three hundred pounds he had found.\n\"Do what thou wilt, but harm none\" was the motto he upheld his entire life.\nHe was once a formal Nighthawk, but he was always just one step away from advancement. As he grew older, the Church suggested he become a \"Gatekeeper\" or retire home, but he refused. He only wished to remain at Blackthorn, guarding those yellowed classics and lighting a lamp for everyone.\nAmidst the usual humor and lighthearted interactions, no one knew that Old Neil had been saving money, attempting to resurrect his late wife using the forbidden \"Life Creation\" ritual. Beside the formula requiring blood materials, he wrote: \"Consider drawing mine.\"—he would rather use his own blood than harm anyone.\nUntil the whispers of the Hidden Sage engulfed him, and his teammates had to personally bid him farewell... When the Nighthawks opened Old Neil's diary and saw the last page written: \"If I cannot save her, then I shall accompany her,\" they finally understood Old Neil's final persistence.\nHe wanted to light up a short path for the young ones with the rest of his life, and then, with his life, fulfill a vow no one knew.",
